        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every roll is a risk. Every risk is a thrill.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dicealot is a high-stakes roguelike dice-builder where every roll is a risk, every risk is a thrill, and every thrill teeters between triumph and disaster. Roll in search of devastating strikes, gamble in the hunt for nail-biting payoffs, and push your luck to its very limits as you battle to conquer your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the charmingly chaotic realm of Camelot, chance collides with strategy, mastery dances with madness, and one single roll can rewrite your fate. The twist? Keep rolling to stack bigger combos and score more points, but push too far, and you’ll lose everything you’ve gained that turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every roll matters. Every choice could be your last. Do you dare to keep rolling when the Kingdom itself hangs in the balance? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/f26a15eb9e42a41559050977598d3c8d.poster.avif?t=1772079941\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/f26a15eb9e42a41559050977598d3c8d.webm?t=1772079941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Dice. Your Strategy. Your Skill.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll begin each run with a simple set of dice, but between battles you’ll stop at shops to expand and refine your collection. Some dice tilt the odds in your favour, others amplify your scores, and a few can backfire entirely, unless you’ve saved enough re-rolls to turn the tide. It’s up to you to experiment and discover the perfect combinations to save King Arthur and smite his foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield one of 10 distinct weapons that fundamentally transform the way you play. Maybe you favour steady, smaller, but consistent hits, or perhaps you thrive on the thrill of chasing the biggest rolls? Every choice unlocks a unique playstyle and demands a new strategy, putting your fate in your own hands as you forge your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/3876674ab878ae39d35f80a0cd659d16.poster.avif?t=1772079941\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/3876674ab878ae39d35f80a0cd659d16.webm?t=1772079941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Madness to Save the King.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange and sinister fate has befallen King Arthur, cursed by a spell that threatens all of Camelot. Now Queen Guinevere must rally the loyal Knights of the Round Table and lead them through a medieval kingdom that’s both charmingly unhinged and dangerously unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the mayhem on your own terms in this roguelike, where Farkle-inspired combat meets deck-building depth. Every decision you make will shape your fate, and victory belongs to those bold enough to embrace the chaos and risk it all for the perfect combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/bed3e735f826604e100f73e5575ca298.poster.avif?t=1772079941\" width=530 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/bed3e735f826604e100f73e5575ca298.webm?t=1772079941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/bed3e735f826604e100f73e5575ca298.mp4?t=1772079941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-risk, high-reward, high-stakes gameplay</strong>, where every decision matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ unique dice to encounter</strong> for progressive dice-building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 distinct weapons</strong> with their own unique abilities to tweak your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ wicked foes</strong> for you to take on within the chaotic Camelot realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 difficulty levels</strong> for endless replayability and to test your mettle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push-your-luck Farkle-inspired combat</strong> will keep you on the edge of your seat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/293b186db613e2338c06a3123b3d311a.poster.avif?t=1772079941\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/293b186db613e2338c06a3123b3d311a.webm?t=1772079941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035330/extras/293b186db613e2338c06a3123b3d311a.mp4?t=1772079941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Your Luck, Hold Your Nerve, Save the Kingdom.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over 30 eclectic enemies, each with varied abilities and unique dice that will test your dice-building skills and strategy. From irate maidens to mystical creatures, your journey will be challenged at every turn. Will you persevere and save your King? Do you have the nerve to keep rolling when everything's on the line?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Push your luck! Master the Madness! Hold Your Nerve! Save the Kingdom!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Wishlist</strong></i></u> Dicealot now to be the first to roll into the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspirations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Balatro, Monster Train, Slay the Spire, Inscryption, and Dicey Dungeons will feel right at home - with a dice-driven twist that’s all Dicealot’s own. <br> </p>",
